{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-392047faad04","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-392047faad04","name":"炒意大利面","category":"staple","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/staple/%E7%82%92%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%A9%E9%9D%A2/%E7%82%92%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%A9%E9%9D%A2.md","blob_sha":"4c0fece04941ca75a4994792f83bfef8fbb82c9d","details":{"introduction":"这道炒意大利面软糯爽口，搭配肥牛和酱料，酱香浓郁，是带有西式风味的家常主食。富含碳水化合物与蛋白质，能快速补充能量。做法简单，新手也能轻松掌握，全程大约需要 30 分钟。","difficulty":"★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 意大利面\n- 肥牛片\n- 番茄酱 / 黑胡椒酱（选其一即可）\n- 菜籽油（其他植物油也可）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 意大利面 50 克 / 人\n- 肥牛 5 片 / 人\n- 食用油 5ml / 50 克意面"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 加入 250 克水 / 人\n2. 待水烧开，下入面条，中火煮 15 - 20 分钟（这个面通常比较硬，捞起来之前最好尝一下，中心如果有一点硬，需要继续煮）\n3. 捞出面条，盛入盘中备用\n4. 热锅倒入食用油，待油温中热，下入面条翻炒一分钟（如果太干，加入少量水）\n5. 放入 10 克番茄酱、肥牛、加入 2g 食盐，继续翻炒一分钟\n6. 起锅"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：煮熟意大利面400g、牛胸腹肉（去骨带脂）200g、番茄酱30g、大豆食用油20g、食盐3g；整份约700g。选择番茄酱分支，肥牛以去骨带脂牛胸腹肉片为标准，熟意面净重。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":192.157143,"protein_g":8.616,"carbohydrate_g":18.991429,"fat_g":8.85},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168928/nutrients","version":"d6d8f4afd5f1e2c2","fdc_ids":[168928,168664,168556,171411,173468]},"profile_id":"family-392047faad04-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-392047faad04","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-392047faad04","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-392047faad04-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"pasta","grams":400},{"key":"beef_brisket","grams":200},{"key":"ketchup